{"ticker":"RF","updated":"2026-10-30T23:09:09Z","profile":{"longName":"Regions Financial Corporation","shortName":"Regions Financial Corporation","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Banks - Regional","country":"United States","website":"https://www.regions.com","fullTimeEmployees":19968,"marketCap":24339625984,"trailingPE":11.203921,"forwardPE":10.035759,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":3.3196435,"pegRatio":1.54,"targetMeanPrice":31.18571,"targetHighPrice":35.0,"targetLowPrice":28.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":21,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":0.052,"earningsGrowth":0.164,"grossMargins":0.0,"operatingMargins":0.41312,"profitMargins":0.31288,"totalRevenue":7331999744,"beta":1.06,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":32.47,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":23.59,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":4.16},"summary":"Regions Financial Corporation, a financial holding company, provides various banking and related products and services to individual and corporate customers. It operates through three segments: Corporate Bank, Consumer Bank, and Wealth Management. The Corporate Bank segment offers commercial banking services, such as commercial and industrial, commercial real estate, and investor real estate lending; equipment lease financing; deposit products; capital markets activities, such as securities underwriting and placement; and loan syndication and placement, foreign exchange, derivatives, merger and acquisition, and other advisory services to corporate, middle market, and commercial real estate developers and investors. The Consumer Bank segment provides consumer banking products and services related to residential first mortgages, home equity lines and loans, consumer credit cards, and other consumer loans, as well as the corresponding deposit relationships. The Wealth Management segment offers credit related products, and retirement and savings solutions; and trust and investment management, asset management, and estate planning to individuals, businesses, governmental institutions, and non-profit entities. It also provides investment and insurance products; home improvement lending, investment advisory services, equipment financing for commercial clients, small business customers","summary_zh":"Regions Financial Corporation 是一家金融控股公司，為個人和企業客戶提供各種銀行及相關產品和服務。它透過三個部門運作：企業銀行、消費者銀行和財富管理。企業銀行部門提供商業銀行服務，例如商業和工業、商業房地產和投資者房地產貸款；設備租賃融資；存款產品；資本市場活動，例如證券承銷和配售；銀團貸款和配售、外匯、衍生品、併購以及為企業、中間市場和商業房地產開發商和投資者提供的其他諮詢服務。消費者銀行部門提供與住宅第一抵押貸款、房屋淨值額度和貸款、消費者信用卡和其他消費貸款以及相應存款關係相關的消費者銀行產品和服務。財富管理部門提供信貸相關產品以及退休和儲蓄解決方案；為個人、企業、政府機構和非營利實體提供信託和投資管理、資產管理和遺產規劃。它還提供投資和保險產品；家居裝修貸款、投資諮詢服務、商業客戶、小型企業客戶的設備融資","sector_zh":"金融服務","industry_zh":"銀行 - 區域","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":26.77,"h":26.92,"l":26.57,"c":26.89,"v":19564500},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":26.84,"h":27.14,"l":26.56,"c":26.94,"v":18485900},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":27.07,"h":27.37,"l":26.9,"c":27.36,"v":17124500},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":27.39,"h":27.61,"l":26.84,"c":27.03,"v":17502300},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":27.11,"h":27.11,"l":26.68,"c":27.04,"v":19666500},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":27.0,"h":27.28,"l":26.65,"c":26.82,"v":21556000},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":26.98,"h":27.24,"l":26.75,"c":27.04,"v":20332400},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":27.06,"h":27.18,"l":26.87,"c":27.04,"v":18682200},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":27.02,"h":27.3,"l":26.9,"c":27.16,"v":17753400},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":27.2,"h":27.23,"l":26.82,"c":26.9,"v":18593100},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":26.95,"h":26.95,"l":26.24,"c":26.56,"v":16191800},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":26.63,"h":27.38,"l":26.57,"c":26.93,"v":20749900},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":26.91,"h":27.46,"l":26.77,"c":27.4,"v":18314900},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":27.4,"h":27.45,"l":27.1,"c":27.16,"v":32203200},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":27.0,"h":27.1,"l":26.51,"c":26.56,"v":18542200},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":26.69,"h":27.17,"l":26.6,"c":26.73,"v":18053700},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":26.74,"h":26.89,"l":26.4,"c":26.66,"v":17567500},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":26.54,"h":26.72,"l":26.37,"c":26.6,"v":13320300},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":26.75,"h":2